There are quite some bad potions that you may sort out before you
start quaffing. Potions of oil, polymorph, sickness identify when
dipping any projectile. If the first test failed continue dipping
a unicorn horn, you'll clear hallu, blindness, confusion. What
remains can be quaffed with the mentioned precauction (due to the
potion of paralysis).

Price ID'ing before dipping helps to optimize the outcome of the
tests.

